# Personal identifiers that must never reach a public file.
# One per line; matched case-insensitively on word boundaries.
# Copy to `.leakpatterns` (git-ignored) and add your own.
#
# Good candidates: machine hostnames, your username, internal codenames,
# employer or client names, anything that identifies you or your network.
#
# my-laptop-hostname
# my-username
# internal-project-codename
